  "_comment": "LTX 2.5 22B distilled text->video with BUILT-IN AUDIO, two-pass: base pass at half resolution (model_map latent_scale 0.5, resolve scales EmptyLTXVLatentVideo), then LTXVLatentUpsampler x2 and a 4-sigma refine — the official ComfyUI LTX 2.5 template shape (all core nodes). ManualSigmas are the distillation's own schedule; `steps` is deliberately inert here. Audio latent rides the whole way (ConcatAV/SeparateAV) and decodes through LTXVAudioVAEDecode into CreateVideo. dim_step 64 in model_map keeps 2x(half/32-snap) == requested, so no final resize node is needed.",
